        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo ILP-206, 6\" Inswing Door Security Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your In-swing side, back and front doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis security door latch protector is 6\" high and designed for inswinging doors (the door opens into the room). Easy to install  with the included fasteners. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Longer <a href=\"/products/12-inch-inswing-door-security-latch-guard-don-jo-ilp-212\"><b>12\" Inswing Door Security Latch Guard</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-ILP-206_size.gif?v=1704354706\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo ILP-206 Inswing Door Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe \"U\" shaped channel screws to the doors face. The protector plate screws to the door jamb.  When the door is closed the 2 plates interlock, guarding the door latch from vandalism. Non-Handed, reversible for left or right hand inswinging doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo ILP-206  Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 3 each #10 x 1-1/4\" one way screws. 3 each #8 x 1-1/4\" WS Flat Head.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ILP-206.pdf?v=1704262262\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo ILP-206 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "6 Inch Inswing Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo ILP-206",
                "description": "Don-Jo ILP-206 Inswing Door Latch Guards. Protect your In-swing side, back and front doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation.  This security door latch protector is 6 inch high and designed for inswinging doors (the door opens into the room). Easy to install  with the included fasteners. ",
